<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Ax1.SS5" title="In Appendix ‣ Flash-dLLM: IO-Aware KV Caching and Parallel Decoding for Fast, Memory-Efficient Diffusion LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Statistical analysis</span></a></li>
