<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Flash-dLLM: IO-Aware KV Caching and Parallel Decoding for Fast, Memory-Efficient Diffusion LLMs</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Quan Nguyen-Tri
