</span><span id="algx3.l7.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;float:right;"><span id="algx3.l7.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#1C69A4;">// SRAM <math id="algx3.l7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#1C69A4;" mathcolor="#1C69A4" stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> HBM</span>
