</figure>
<div id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Selective cache update.</span>
Following our new design of KV caching and scheduled flash attention, we introduce a simple yet effective Constrained cache update to further enhance the scalability of our method. We observed that only 32 of the top-attended tokens can contribute approximately 50% of the weight in attention computation among the middle layers (from layer 5 to 20, as shown in Fig. <a href="#S1.F1.sf2" title="In Figure 1 ‣ 1 Introduction ‣ Flash-dLLM: IO-Aware KV Caching and Parallel Decoding for Fast, Memory-Efficient Diffusion LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1(b)</span></a>). This suggests that updating only a small subset of these tokens could be sufficient to retain most of the information loss. Motivated by this observation, we introduce the Selective cache update approach, which maintains and updates only a fixed set of the most-attended tokens (as depicted in Fig. <a href="#alg2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ Scheduled flash attention. ‣ 2.2 Flash-Cache: IO-aware key-value caching ‣ 2 Methodology ‣ Flash-dLLM: IO-Aware KV Caching and Parallel Decoding for Fast, Memory-Efficient Diffusion LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>).</p>
</div>
<div id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p5.1" class="ltx_p">Our method constructs a fixed-size query at each subsequent decoding step (<math id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>) using a sliding unmasking window of size <math id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{m}</annotation></semantics></math> and a fixed tracking budget <math id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>. Specifically, the query for step <math id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t+1</annotation></semantics></math> is defined as <math id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p5.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{Q}^{t+1}=\mathcal{M}_{\beta_{m}}^{t+1}\cup\mathcal{T}^{t+1}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>∪</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{Q}^{t+1}=\mathcal{M}_{\beta_{m}}^{t+1}\cup\mathcal{T}^{t+1},</annotation></semantics></math>
where <math id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p5.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}^{t+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}^{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math> comprises the newly decoded tokens <math id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p5.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math> and the most-attended tokens from the preceding step. The latter are selected from previously decoded tokens according to the attention they receive from masked tokens. The attention score of each decoded token <math id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p5.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> at step <math id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p5.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> is computed as follows:</p>
<table id="S2.E2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S2.E2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i}^{t}=\sum_{l=1}^{L}\frac{1}{H}\sum_{h=1}^{H}\frac{1}{|\mathcal{M}^{t}_{\beta_{m}}|}\sum_{j\in\mathcal{M}^{t}_{\beta_{m}}}\mathbf{S}^{t,l,h}_{j,i},\quad i\in\mathcal{D}^{&lt;t}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>L</mi></munderover><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>H</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>H</mi></munderover><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mrow></munder><msubsup><mi>𝐒</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i}^{t}=\sum_{l=1}^{L}\frac{1}{H}\sum_{h=1}^{H}\frac{1}{|\mathcal{M}^{t}_{\beta_{m}}|}\sum_{j\in\mathcal{M}^{t}_{\beta_{m}}}\mathbf{S}^{t,l,h}_{j,i},\quad i\in\mathcal{D}^{&lt;t}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(2)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p5.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p5.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{S}^{t,l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>𝐒</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{S}^{t,l}</annotation></semantics></math> is unnormalized attention logits. The score measures the extent to which the current masked queries are paying attention to the decoded position <math id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p5.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>. The tracking set is <math id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p5.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}^{t+1}=\operatorname{top\text{-}k}(\{a_{i}^{t}:i\in\mathcal{D}^{&lt;t}\},\;\beta_{\text{t}}-|\mathcal{D}^{t}|)\cup\mathcal{D}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>top</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mtext>t</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∪</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}^{t+1}=\operatorname{top\text{-}k}(\{a_{i}^{t}:i\in\mathcal{D}^{&lt;t}\},\;\beta_{\text{t}}-|\mathcal{D}^{t}|)\cup\mathcal{D}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, and the next query set is <math id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p5.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{Q}^{t+1}=\mathcal{M}^{t+1}_{\beta_{m}}\cup\mathcal{T}^{t+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>∪</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{Q}^{t+1}=\mathcal{M}^{t+1}_{\beta_{m}}\cup\mathcal{T}^{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math>. Newly decoded tokens are prepended to <math id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p5.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}^{&lt;t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}^{&lt;t}</annotation></semantics></math> before ranking, giving them automatic inclusion. All other decoded positions are served from cache without participating as queries, bounding per-step compute at <math id="S2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p5.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{t}+\beta_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{t}+\beta_{m}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg2" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span> Flash-dLLM</figcaption>
<div id="alg2.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algx4.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
                
                
              Model <math id="algx4.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math>, prompt <math id="algx4.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{\text{prompt}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mtext>prompt</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{\text{prompt}}</annotation></semantics></math>, generation length <math id="algx4.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>, tracking budget <math id="algx4.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, masked-window size <math id="algx4.l1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{m}</annotation></semantics></math>, confidence threshold <math id="algx4.l1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math>, verify threshold <math id="algx4.l1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="algx4.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
                
                
              <math id="algx4.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}^{0}\!\leftarrow\!\{\mathbf{x}_{\text{prompt}};\,\texttt{[MASK]}^{N}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.108em" rspace="0.108em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mtext>prompt</mtext></msub><mo rspace="0.337em">;</mo><msup><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">[MASK]</mtext><mi>N</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}^{0}\!\leftarrow\!\{\mathbf{x}_{\text{prompt}};\,\texttt{[MASK]}^{N}\}</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="algx4.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}^{&lt;1}\!\leftarrow\!\{1,\dots,|\mathbf{x}_{\text{prompt}}|\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0.108em" rspace="0.108em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mtext>prompt</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}^{&lt;1}\!\leftarrow\!\{1,\dots,|\mathbf{x}_{\text{prompt}}|\}</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="algx4.l2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}^{1}\!\leftarrow\!\{|\mathbf{x}_{\text{prompt}}|{+}1,\dots,|\mathbf{x}_{\text{prompt}}|{+}N\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo lspace="0.108em" rspace="0.108em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mtext>prompt</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mtext>prompt</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}^{1}\!\leftarrow\!\{|\mathbf{x}_{\text{prompt}}|{+}1,\dots,|\mathbf{x}_{\text{prompt}}|{+}N\}</annotation></semantics></math>;

</div>
<div id="algx4.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
                
                
              Allocate KV cache <math id="algx4.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\mathbf{K}}^{l},\tilde{\mathbf{V}}^{l}\in\mathbb{R}^{(B\cdot N_{\max})\times d_{\text{model}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐊</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>l</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐕</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>l</mi></msup><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>model</mtext></msub></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\mathbf{K}}^{l},\tilde{\mathbf{V}}^{l}\in\mathbb{R}^{(B\cdot N_{\max})\times d_{\text{model}}}</annotation></semantics></math> for each layer <math id="algx4.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>l</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algx4.l3.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><span id="algx4.l3.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#1C69A4;">// pre-allocate once</span>
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx4.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="algx4.l4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">while</span> <math id="algx4.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}^{t}\neq\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>≠</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}^{t}\neq\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algx4.l4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="algx4.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
                
                
                <math id="algx4.l5.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathcal{M}^{t}_{\beta_{m}}\leftarrow\mathcal{M}^{t}_{[:\beta_{m}]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>β</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}^{t}_{\beta_{m}}\leftarrow\mathcal{M}^{t}_{[:\beta_{m}]}</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="algx4.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{Q}^{t}\leftarrow\mathcal{T}^{t}\cup\mathcal{M}^{t}_{\beta_{m}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>∪</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{Q}^{t}\leftarrow\mathcal{T}^{t}\cup\mathcal{M}^{t}_{\beta_{m}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx4.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
                
                
                <math id="algx4.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}\mid\mathbf{x}^{t}),\,\mathbf{S}\leftarrow\texttt{FusedForward}(f_{\theta},\,\mathbf{x}^{t}_{[\mathcal{Q}^{t}]},\,\tilde{\mathbf{K}},\,\tilde{\mathbf{V}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mi>𝐒</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">FusedForward</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐊</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐕</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}\mid\mathbf{x}^{t}),\,\mathbf{S}\leftarrow\texttt{FusedForward}(f_{\theta},\,\mathbf{x}^{t}_{[\mathcal{Q}^{t}]},\,\tilde{\mathbf{K}},\,\tilde{\mathbf{V}})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algx4.l6.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><span id="algx4.l6.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#CA0020;">// Flash-Cache, Alg. <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Scheduled flash attention. ‣ 2.2 Flash-Cache: IO-aware key-value caching ‣ 2 Methodology ‣ Flash-dLLM: IO-Aware KV Caching and Parallel Decoding for Fast, Memory-Efficient Diffusion LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a></span>
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx4.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
                
                
                <math id="algx4.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c^{i},\hat{x}^{i}\leftarrow\max_{x}\,p_{\theta}(x^{i}\mid\mathbf{x}^{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>max</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c^{i},\hat{x}^{i}\leftarrow\max_{x}\,p_{\theta}(x^{i}\mid\mathbf{x}^{t})</annotation></semantics></math>  for <math id="algx4.l7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in\mathcal{M}^{t}_{\beta_{m}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in\mathcal{M}^{t}_{\beta_{m}}</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="algx4.l7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}^{t}\leftarrow\{i\in\mathcal{M}^{t}_{\beta_{m}}:c^{i}\geq\epsilon\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>≥</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}^{t}\leftarrow\{i\in\mathcal{M}^{t}_{\beta_{m}}:c^{i}\geq\epsilon\}</annotation></semantics></math> ; <math id="algx4.l7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}^{t}\leftarrow\mathcal{M}^{t}_{\beta_{m}}\setminus\mathcal{D}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>∖</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}^{t}\leftarrow\mathcal{M}^{t}_{\beta_{m}}\setminus\mathcal{D}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx4.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
                
                
                <span id="algx4.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <span id="algx4.l8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_typewriter">verify</span> <span id="algx4.l8.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">and</span> <math id="algx4.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}^{t}\neq\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>≠</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}^{t}\neq\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algx4.l8.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span> <span id="algx4.l8.7" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><span id="algx4.l8.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#CA0020;">// Flash-Verify</span>
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx4.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
                
                
                 Adjust tracking set <math id="algx4.l9.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathcal{T}^{t}_{v}\leftarrow\mathcal{T}^{t}_{[:2\beta_{m}-|\mathcal{D}^{t}|-2|\mathcal{S}^{t}|]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>v</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>β</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub><mo rspace="0em">−</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msup><mo fence="false" stretchy="false">|</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msup><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}^{t}_{v}\leftarrow\mathcal{T}^{t}_{[:2\beta_{m}-|\mathcal{D}^{t}|-2|\mathcal{S}^{t}|]}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx4.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
                
                
                 Construct verify query: <math id="algx4.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\mathbf{x}_{[\mathcal{T}^{t}_{v}]}^{t};\mathbf{\hat{x}}_{[\mathcal{D}^{t}]};\;\mathbf{\hat{x}}_{[\mathcal{S}^{t}]};\mathbf{x}^{t}_{[\mathcal{S}^{t}]}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>;</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.447em">;</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></msub><mo>;</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\mathbf{x}_{[\mathcal{T}^{t}_{v}]}^{t};\mathbf{\hat{x}}_{[\mathcal{D}^{t}]};\;\mathbf{\hat{x}}_{[\mathcal{S}^{t}]};\mathbf{x}^{t}_{[\mathcal{S}^{t}]}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx4.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
                
                
                 Construct causal mask for bi-directional attention <math id="algx4.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐌</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{M}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx4.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
                
                
                 <math id="algx4.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}\mid\mathbf{\hat{x}}_{[\mathcal{S}^{t}]})\leftarrow\texttt{FusedForward}(f_{\theta},\,\text{verify query},\,\tilde{\mathbf{K}},\,\tilde{\mathbf{V}},\,\mathbf{M})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">FusedForward</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mtext>verify query</mtext><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐊</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐕</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐌</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}\mid\mathbf{\hat{x}}_{[\mathcal{S}^{t}]})\leftarrow\texttt{FusedForward}(f_{\theta},\,\text{verify query},\,\tilde{\mathbf{K}},\,\tilde{\mathbf{V}},\,\mathbf{M})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx4.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">13:</span></span>
                
                
                 <math id="algx4.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{c}^{i},\tilde{x}^{i}\leftarrow\max_{x}\,p_{\theta}(x^{i}\mid\mathbf{\hat{x}}_{[\mathcal{S}^{t}]})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>c</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>max</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{c}^{i},\tilde{x}^{i}\leftarrow\max_{x}\,p_{\theta}(x^{i}\mid\mathbf{\hat{x}}_{[\mathcal{S}^{t}]})</annotation></semantics></math>  for <math id="algx4.l13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in\mathcal{S}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in\mathcal{S}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx4.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">14:</span></span>
                
                
                 <math id="algx4.l14.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathcal{D}^{t}\leftarrow\mathcal{D}^{t}\cup\{i\in\mathcal{S}^{t}:\hat{x}^{i}=\tilde{x}^{i}\;\wedge\;\tilde{c}^{i}\geq\gamma,\;\text{up to first mismatch}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msup><mo rspace="0.502em">∧</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>c</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>≥</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo rspace="0.447em">,</mo><mtext>up to first mismatch</mtext><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}^{t}\leftarrow\mathcal{D}^{t}\cup\{i\in\mathcal{S}^{t}:\hat{x}^{i}=\tilde{x}^{i}\;\wedge\;\tilde{c}^{i}\geq\gamma,\;\text{up to first mismatch}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx4.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l15.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">15:</span></span>
                
                
                <span id="algx4.l15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="algx4.l15.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="algx4.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l16.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">16:</span></span>
                
                
                Decode: <math id="algx4.l16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}^{t+1}_{[\mathcal{D}^{t}]}\leftarrow\mathbf{\hat{x}}_{[\mathcal{D}^{t}]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}^{t+1}_{[\mathcal{D}^{t}]}\leftarrow\mathbf{\hat{x}}_{[\mathcal{D}^{t}]}</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="algx4.l16.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}^{&lt;t+1}\leftarrow\mathcal{D}^{&lt;t}\cup\mathcal{D}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>∪</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}^{&lt;t+1}\leftarrow\mathcal{D}^{&lt;t}\cup\mathcal{D}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="algx4.l16.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}^{t+1}\leftarrow\mathcal{M}^{t}\setminus\mathcal{D}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>∖</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}^{t+1}\leftarrow\mathcal{M}^{t}\setminus\mathcal{D}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx4.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l17.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">17:</span></span>
                
                
                <math id="algx4.l17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i}^{t}\leftarrow\sum_{l}\frac{1}{H|\mathcal{M}^{t}_{\beta_{m}}|}\sum_{h,\,j\in\mathcal{M}^{t}_{\beta_{m}}}\mathbf{S}^{t,l,h}_{j,i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo rspace="0.111em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>l</mi></msub><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></msub><msubsup><mi>𝐒</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i}^{t}\leftarrow\sum_{l}\frac{1}{H|\mathcal{M}^{t}_{\beta_{m}}|}\sum_{h,\,j\in\mathcal{M}^{t}_{\beta_{m}}}\mathbf{S}^{t,l,h}_{j,i}</annotation></semantics></math>  for <math id="algx4.l17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in\mathcal{D}^{&lt;t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in\mathcal{D}^{&lt;t}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx4.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l18.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">18:</span></span>
                
                
                <math id="algx4.l18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}^{t+1}=\operatorname{top\text{-}k}(\{a_{i}^{t}:i\in\mathcal{D}^{&lt;t}\},\;\beta_{\text{t}}-|\mathcal{D}^{t}|)\cup\mathcal{D}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>top</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mtext>t</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∪</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}^{t+1}=\operatorname{top\text{-}k}(\{a_{i}^{t}:i\in\mathcal{D}^{&lt;t}\},\;\beta_{\text{t}}-|\mathcal{D}^{t}|)\cup\mathcal{D}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math>  <math id="algx4.l18.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leftarrow t+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leftarrow t+1</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx4.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l19.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">19:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="algx4.l19.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="algx4.l19.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">while</span>
</div>
<div id="algx4.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx4.l20.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">20:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="algx4.l20.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="algx4.l20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
